From db4e71b91e74abd76909646d7d8adecb27bd6805 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Head of Security <security@buildwithaai.invalid>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:57:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Make predeploy a read-only check that something actually runs
 (L-15)

- Opens the file read-only, never creates it, never migrates, never writes an alert.
- A missing file, old-hash rows, or a broken chain exits 1.
- Declares vite-node, which the script needs and which only arrived through vitest.
- HOSTING_FLY.md: check a VACUUM INTO copy of /data before a redeploy.
---
